  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) ÷ and ×**\n\n→ 35 + **84 ÷ 4** × 3 – 11 = 87\n\n→ 35 + **21 ×**** 3** – 11 = 87\n\n→ **35 + 63** – 11 = 87\n\n→ 98 – 11 = 87\n\n→ 87 = 87\n\n→ **LHS = RHS** → **Satisfies the equation**\n\n**2) × and +**\n\n→ 35 × 84 + **4 ÷ 3** – 11 = 87\n\n→ **35 ****× 84** + 4/3 – 11 = 87\n\n→ 2940 + 4/3 – 11 = 87\n\n→ 8824/3 – 11 = 87\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS **\n\n**3) ÷ and –**\n\n→ 35 + 84 × 4 - **3 ÷ 11** = 87\n\n→ 35 + **84 × 4** - 3/11 = 87\n\n→ **35 + 336** - 3/11 = 87\n\n→ 371 - 3/11 = 87\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS \n\n**4) – and ×**\n\n→ 35 + 84 - **4 ÷ 3** × 11 = 87\n\n→ 35 + 84 - **4/3 ×**** 11** = 87\n\n→ **35 + 84** - 44/3 = 87\n\n→ 119 - 44/3 = 87\n\n→ 313/3 ≠ 87\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS \n\nHere, we can see that only Option 1 satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"÷ and ×\".**",
